description: A speaker and author whose ideas moved rooms but got lost the moment people left them.
scope:
  - Personal Brand
  - Web Presence
  - Content Direction
heroImage: ../../assets/artist1.jpg
heroImageAlt: The refined personal brand created for speaker and author Nova Mbeki.
story:
  challenge: >
    On stage, Nova was unforgettable. Online, that magnetism thinned out. The presence
    didn't carry the same conviction, and opportunities slipped because people couldn't
    feel who she was until they met her in person.
  approach: >
    We translated the room into the screen. A presence with the same clarity and calm
    authority as her talks, built so a scroll feels like a conversation. Every choice
    was made to let her ideas land with the weight they carry in a live audience.
  outcome: >
    Nova now arrives online the way she arrives on stage: assured, warm, and clear.
    The right invitations find her, and the people who discover her digitally already
    sense the presence they'd have felt in the front row.
testimonial:
  quote: People used to 'get it' only after seeing me speak. Now they get it before we've even met.
  attribution: Nova Mbeki
liveLink: https://example.com/nova-mbeki
pullQuote: Presence isn't only for the stage. We gave hers somewhere to live between the talks.
---

Some people fill a room instantly. The work here was making sure the screen filled just
as fast, so nothing about Nova got lost in translation.
